value.description:
Shaped by the operator and the field type:

- no value for `is_empty`, `is_not_empty`, `is_true`, `is_false`, `is_not_true`, `is_not_false`;
- a list of 1 to 50 values for `is_any_of`, `is_none_of`, `contains_any_of`, `contains_all_of`, also accepted on a text field for `contains`, `does_not_contain`, `starts_with`, `ends_with` (matching any of them);
- `{ "from", "to" }` for `is_between`, one side may be omitted;
- `{ "mode", "amount", "unit" }` for `is_relative`, with `mode` among `this`, `last`, `next`, `past` and `unit` among `day`, `week`, `month`, `quarter`, `year`;
- one value otherwise: a number on a number field, an ISO 8601 date (`YYYY-MM-DD`) or date-time with offset on a date field, a string on the others.

A field listing `options` takes their `value`. A user, list or campaign field takes record ids: user ids from [Get Team](/api-reference/endpoints/team/get-team), list ids from [Get Contact Lists](/api-reference/endpoints/contacts/get-contact-lists) or [Get Company Lists](/api-reference/endpoints/companies/get-company-lists), campaign ids from [Get Many Campaigns](/api-reference/endpoints/campaigns/get-many-campaigns).
